				<div class="hero_content_text container">
					<div class="jumbotron">
						<p>&nbsp;</p>
<h1>Promoting Openness &amp; Accountability</h1>
<p>The Arkansas Ethics Commission was established in 1991 as a result of the voters&#8217; approval of Initiated Act I of 1990.</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
													<a class="comman_btn" href="https://www.arkansasethics.com/about/" target="_self">Find Out More</a>
											</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
		
		<div class="mission_section">
			<div class="container">
									<div class="red_sect">
						<div class="row nomargin">
							<!--Start Repater-->
															<div class="col-md-3 nopadding">
									<div class="red_box light">
										<div class="icon_style">
											<img class="img-fluid" src="https://www.arkansasethics.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/10/icon1.svg" alt="" />
										</div>
										<h3>View Decisions in Contested Matters</h3>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
																					<a class="comman_btn" href="https://www.arkansasethics.com/2413-2/" target="_self">Find Out More</a>
																			</div>
								</div>
															<div class="col-md-3 nopadding">
									<div class="red_box ">
										<div class="icon_style">
											<img class="img-fluid" src="https://www.arkansasethics.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/10/icon3.svg" alt="" />
										</div>
										<h3>New Ballot and Legislative Question Committees</h3>
																					<a class="comman_btn" href="https://www.arkansasethics.com/new-lo-bqcs-bqcs-and-lqcs/" target="_self">Find Out More</a>
																			</div>
								</div>
															<div class="col-md-3 nopadding">
									<div class="red_box light">
										<div class="icon_style">
											<img class="img-fluid" src="https://www.arkansasethics.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/10/icon4.svg" alt="" />
										</div>
										<h3>Reporting Calendars</h3>
																					<a class="comman_btn" href="https://www.arkansasethics.com/reporting-calendars/" target="_self">Find Out More</a>
																			</div>
								</div>
															<div class="col-md-3 nopadding">
									<div class="red_box ">
										<div class="icon_style">
											<img class="img-fluid" src="https://www.arkansasethics.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/10/icon4.svg" alt="" />
										</div>
										<h3>Citizen Complaints</h3>
																					<a class="comman_btn" href="https://www.arkansasethics.com/citizen-complaints/" target="_blank">Citizen Complaints</a>
																			</div>
								</div>
															<div class="col-md-3 nopadding">
									<div class="red_box light">
										<div class="icon_style">
											<img class="img-fluid" src="https://www.arkansasethics.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/10/icon4.svg" alt="" />
										</div>
										<h3><strong>Campaign Contribution Limit</strong></h3>
																					<a class="comman_btn" href="https://www.arkansasethics.com/campaign-contribution-limit/" target="_self">Campaign Contribution Limit</a>
																			</div>
								</div>
															<div class="col-md-3 nopadding">
									<div class="red_box ">
										<div class="icon_style">
											<img class="img-fluid" src="https://www.arkansasethics.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/10/icon2.svg" alt="" />
										</div>
										<h3><strong>Helpful Links</strong></h3>
																					<a class="comman_btn" href="https://www.arkansasethics.com/helpful-links/" target="_self">Helpful Links</a>
																			</div>
								</div>
														<!--End Repater-->
						</div>
					</div>
								<div class="ourmission_style">
					<h3>Our Mission</h3>
<p>THE MISSION OF THE ARKANSAS ETHICS COMMISSION IS TO SERVE AS THE COMPLIANCE AND ENFORCEMENT AGENCY UNDER ARKANSAS&#8217;S STANDARDS OF CONDUCT AND DISCLOSURE LAWS CONCERNING CANDIDATES FOR PUBLIC OFFICE, STATE AND LOCAL PUBLIC OFFICIALS, LOBBYISTS AND COMMITTEES, AND INDIVIDUALS INVOLVED WITH INITIATIVES, REFERENDA, AND OTHER MATTERS REFERRED TO THE VOTERS.</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p>Please note that the Arkansas Ethics Commission has moved to 101 East Capitol Avenue, Suite 204, Little Rock, Arkansas 72201.</p>
											<a class="comman_btn" href="https://www.arkansasethics.com/about/" target="_self">Find Out More</a>
									</div>
			</div>
		</div>
		<div class="jumping_points">
			<div class="container">
				<div class="row nomargin">
					<div class="col-md-4 nopadding">
						<div class="jumping_heading">
							<h4>Quick <span>View</span></h4>						</div>
